    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφώς</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφῶς</span></b>  (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>great sea-perch, Epinephelus gigas,</i> still called
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφός</span> in Greece, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				493
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				173.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Amips.
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				543b1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				591a11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.315b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				295b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Grg.</u>
				p.360
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i> ; <i>orphus rubens,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				32.152
			</span></i>. (Nom. sg. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					543b1
				</span></i>
			 (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					591a11
				</span></i>
			): Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.224
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρφος κοινῶς, ὀρφῶς δὲ
				Ἀττικῶς,</span> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; but <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.315b
			</span></i> states that nom. 
				Att.
			 is <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφώς,</span> citing <i><span class="en">
				Archipp.
				17
			</span></i>; gen. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφώ</span>
			Cratin.l.c., acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
				</span></i>
			 Com.<i><span class="en">
				173.13
			</span></i>, dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φῷσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					56
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Amips.
			</span></i> l.c., acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φώς</span>
			Ar.l.c.)</div>
